  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/kalversteeg.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Kalversteeg (the city, district 5: the Kalverstraat): the narrow lane from the Kalverstraat along the Singel's quay through to Muntplein: bins, bikes chained to the drainpipes, the back door of a restaurant's kitchen, the flower market's stalls across the water. Modelled after openly licensed photographs; every business name is made up, the landmarks keep theirs. The power is still on; nobody is there. Outdoor (street.py, city.py and landmarks.py build it). Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
